OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of fake clothes and
OL,4,Aperfume seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 3,000 items of counterfeit
OL,7,Fclothes and perfumes worth #60,000 have
OL,8,Fbeen seized following tip-offs from
OL,9,Fmembers of the public in the
OL,10,FLancashire.
OL,12,FThree van loads of items with brand
OL,13,Fnames including Nike, North Face, Dior,
OL,14,FBerghaus and Hugo Boss were confiscated
OL,15,Fafter they were found for sale at two
OL,16,Fpremises in Accrington, Lancashire
OL,17,FCounty Council said.
OL,19,FA trading standards officer posing as a
OL,20,Fcustomer was able to buy branded
OL,21,Fperfume for #10, which was later
OL,22,Fconfirmed to be fake.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
